00:00:36.337 --> 00:00:38.772 size:53% position:73% line:53%
E ANGLADE, cheffe,

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:39.740 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Parti libéral du Québec

00:00:38.105 --> 00:00:40.707 size:53% position:73% line:53%
