00:01:44.505 --> 00:01:49.709 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Dominique Anglade.

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:51.145 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Si certains espèrent

00:01:48.375 --> 00:01:52.279 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tendance du vote

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:53.814 size:53% position:73% line:53%
se maintienne...

00:01:51.478 --> 00:01:55.149 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- I've always voted Liberal

00:01:52.613 --> 00:01:56.316 size:53% position:73% line:53%
and I think Dominique

00:01:55.082 --> 00:01:57.484 size:53% position:73% line:53%
