00:01:55.482 --> 00:01:58.619 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- ... d'autres se disent

00:01:56.650 --> 00:01:59.620 size:53% position:73% line:53%
prêts pour du changement.

00:01:57.818 --> 00:02:00.587 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On pense à Mme Anglade

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:01.588 size:53% position:73% line:53%
puis on trouve ça dommage

00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:02.556 size:53% position:73% line:53%
parce qu'on respec

00:02:00.921 --> 00:02:03.524 size:53% position:73% line:53%
on aime cette personne.

00:02:01.922 --> 00:02:07.027 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mais les idées de Québec

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:08.028 size:53% position:73% line:53%
solidaire, c'est les nôtres.

00:02:03.857 --> 00:02:08.996 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- La CAQ.- Pourquoi la CAQ?

00:02:07.361 --> 00:02:11.432 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Parce que c'est les seuls qui

00:02:08.362 --> 00:02:12.399 size:53% position:73% line:53%
