00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:29.082 size:53% position:73% line:53%
On a besoin de brasser la cage.

00:02:27.481 --> 00:02:31.018 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Est-ce que vous gardez

00:02:28.415 --> 00:02:32.019 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le moral quand même?

00:02:29.416 --> 00:02:32.986 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le moral de la députéesortant.

00:02:31.351 --> 00:02:34.955 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Moi, je vais gagner

00:02:32.352 --> 00:02:35.923 size:53% position:73% line:53%
