00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:36.890 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Je suis confiante, là.

00:02:35.289 --> 00:02:37.891 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Consciente aussi que c'est

00:02:36.423 --> 00:02:38.859 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ici que son avenir

00:02:37.224 --> 00:02:39.359 size:53% position:73% line:53%
politique se jouera lundi.

00:02:38.225 --> 00:02:39.359 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ici Mathieu Papillon,

